OL,3,GNEWSAWales Green Party to pick new
OL,4,Aleader to replace Anthony Slaughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Party members in Wales will vote
OL,7,Flater this year to decide who will take
OL,8,Fover from Anthony Slaughter as party
OL,9,Fleader.
OL,11,FSlaughter, who has led the party since
OL,12,F2018, is required by party rules to
OL,13,Fstep away from the job after completing
OL,14,Fthree terms.
OL,16,FWith his fellow Member of the Senedd
OL,17,F(MS) Paul Rock ruling himself out, it
OL,18,Fmeans the next leader will be from
OL,19,Foutside the Welsh Parliament.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
